# Bricks Builder JSON Output

```json
{
  "version": "1.0",
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "container",
      "properties": {
        "id": "header-container",
        "className": "header",
        "styles": {
          "display": "flex",
          "justifyContent": "space-between",
          "alignItems": "center",
          "padding": "20px",
          "backgroundColor": "#ffffff"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "properties": {
              "content": "Welcome to [COMPANY]",
              "styles": {
                "fontSize": "24px",
                "fontWeight": "bold"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "button",
            "properties": {
              "content": "Contact Us",
              "styles": {
                "padding": "10px 20px",
                "backgroundColor": "#007bff",
                "color": "#ffffff",
                "borderRadius": "5px"
              },
              "interactions": {
                "onClick": "openContactForm()"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

